{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/169063-shy-elodoth","id":169063,"title":"Shy Elodoth","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-14T11:55:26-07:00","id":169063,"title":"Shy Elodoth","content":"So in our Sweden game we have a new playeress that is playing first time in her life. She made a very Elodoth character - political science student, Virtue: Honest, Vice: Irresponsible - so I made her Half Moon Uratha. She also is interesting in joining Storm Lords as a Tribe. Thing is this - she is totally shy as player. She speak maybe 3 sentace in whole game session. I feel she could be good player, but is intimidated by our Rahu Alfa and even rest of pack. Maybe some classical task of Elodoth, only for her, will help her? If yes, what could be them? As myself I don't have good feel of this Auspice also...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-14T12:24:27-07:00","id":169114,"title":"","content":"This isn't something you have to address in character; This is something you gotta address out of character. The first red flag? Why are you making the character for her? It's very common for a first-time player to be shy around the table, so I recommend you bring up the 'issue' delicately and see if you can nudge her into being more active, and into letting the other players share the spotlight with her.<br /> <br /> Are you sure the issue is your other players attitudes? Are you sure her character isn't naturally shy? That's the first two things you gotta figure out. How? Communication.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-14T13:59:23-07:00","id":169236,"title":"","content":"Perhaps some more one on one sessions to try to get her to appreciate her character more? A big disconnect between new players and their characters are the dots on the sheet mentality. Help them remember that they are the character. Ask them what their characters hobbies are, maybe play them in a day to day scenario... Example: Walking through the local grocery store she stops infront of the beverage aisle, what does she grab? <br /> <br /> Little things like that will help.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-14T17:12:44-07:00","id":169332,"title":"","content":"Was there a prelude? Did she answer the usual character questionnaire?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T01:28:47-07:00","id":169604,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/169063-shy-elodoth?p=169332#post169332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Was there a prelude? Did she answer the usual character questionnaire?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, we didn't fo that, as she joined game and we added her in time of play. She made a character with me over two weekdays nights. But rest was okay with this approche., till her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T03:06:04-07:00","id":169653,"title":"","content":"I would sneak some time alone with her and do some character building. Gotta make her give a damn.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":""